{"id":"c92e0574d85ca895","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems.md","title":"满ω模型满足主要二阶算术系统","display":"thm-full-omega-model-subsystems — 满ω模型满足主要二阶算术系统","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems","aliases":["72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems"],"display":"thm-full-omega-model-subsystems — 满ω模型满足主要二阶算术系统","depends_on":["[[72-df-full-omega-model]]","[[72-df-wkl0]]","[[72-df-aca0]]","[[72-df-pi11-ca0]]","[[72-df-atr0]]"],"chapter":"IV","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV subsystem definitions; source conventions and local ZFC model construction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-full-omega-model-subsystems — 满ω模型满足主要二阶算术系统"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d363e181512f2d28\" href=\"?note=d363e181512f2d28\" title=\"72-df-full-omega-model\">72-df-full-omega-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"109b0b8d7ee4cec9\" href=\"?note=109b0b8d7ee4cec9\" title=\"72-df-wkl0\">72-df-wkl0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"89c91257b92fc1e7\" href=\"?note=89c91257b92fc1e7\" title=\"72-df-aca0\">72-df-aca0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"da3a454fea13ee06\" href=\"?note=da3a454fea13ee06\" title=\"72-df-pi11-ca0\">72-df-pi11-ca0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b0618eb9c08a1bca\" href=\"?note=b0618eb9c08a1bca\" title=\"72-df-atr0\">72-df-atr0</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IV"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV subsystem definitions; source conventions and local ZFC model construction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>元理论为 ZFC，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{OM}\">\\(\\mathsf{OM}\\)</span> 为上述满ω模型。各公理集合取本册明确的实际语法版本；WKL 使用新固定的 PR 定义扩充。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{OM}\\models\\mathsf{RCA}_0,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{OM}\\models\\mathsf{WKL}_0,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{OM}\\models\\mathsf{ACA}_0,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{OM}\\models\\Pi^1_1\\operatorname{-CA}_0,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{OM}\\models\\mathsf{ATR}_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{OM}\\models\\mathsf{RCA}_0,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{OM}\\models\\mathsf{WKL}_0,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{OM}\\models\\mathsf{ACA}_0,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{OM}\\models\\Pi^1_1\\operatorname{-CA}_0,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{OM}\\models\\mathsf{ATR}_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>标准自然数满足 B_N 与每个归纳实例；集合分离给任意指定公式的概括见证，因此满足所列受限概括。程序定义方程由程序解释递归成立。无限前缀闭二叉树在每层有点；从根开始选仍有任意长延伸的一个孩子，递归构成分支，子集域包含这条分支。对对象 WO 的真值，满子集域使其正是真实良序；沿该集合良序作 ZFC 递归，按 θ 定义各切片并以配对编码汇成 H，给 ATR 实例。该结论是外部标准模型存在性，不等于弱系统在内部证明自己的可靠性或这些模型论原则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-full-omega-model","status":"resolved","id":"d363e181512f2d28","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-full-omega-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-wkl0","status":"resolved","id":"109b0b8d7ee4cec9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-wkl0]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-aca0","status":"resolved","id":"89c91257b92fc1e7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-aca0]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-pi11-ca0","status":"resolved","id":"da3a454fea13ee06","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-pi11-ca0]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-atr0","status":"resolved","id":"b0618eb9c08a1bca","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-atr0]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{OM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{OM}\\models\\mathsf{RCA}_0,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{OM}\\models\\mathsf{WKL}_0,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{OM}\\models\\mathsf{ACA}_0,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{OM}\\models\\Pi^1_1\\operatorname{-CA}_0,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{OM}\\models\\mathsf{ATR}_0.","display":true}],"bytes":1906,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增5项：[[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]] · [[72-df-full-omega-model]] · [[72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library]] · [[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]] · [[72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增5项：[[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]] · [[72-df-full-omega-model]] · [[72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library]] · [[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]] · [[72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems]]"},{"id":"7